 "note": "Holmboe, Holst, Holzbauer, Honegger, Hosokawa. All 27 Holmboe works match the Kontra cycle and Rapoport-based list (opus, years, movements, minutes). Open questions for the owner: Honegger Rapsodie (wind original) and Holzbauer B-flat quintet (continuo or separate theorbo/cello)."
